WEBVTT

0:00:00.000 --> 0:00:06.102
Through you we can also be conqueror, we can
also be the winner, we can also be the race

0:00:06.102 --> 0:00:07.885
winner Lord Jesus Christ.

0:00:07.817 --> 0:00:13.744
Thank you for the worship that we can just
praise your name because this is how it is

0:00:13.744 --> 0:00:19.948
Lord for us to just keep praising your name,
keep glorifying your name, no other name but

0:00:19.948 --> 0:00:21.188
yours Lord Jesus.

0:00:20.640 --> 0:00:21.737
Christ.

